<title>MALTA: SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT MALTA 4-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT MALTA 4-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary beat Malta 4-1 (halftime 2-0) in an international soccer friendly match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malta - Andar Kereszturi own goal 84</p>
<p>Hungary - Florian Urban 18,  Gabor Halmai 40, Perec Orosz 66, 87.</p>
